{"timestamp":"15:45:55.760","source":"Browser","level":"LOG","message":"[useProposalGenerator] Raw AI output for \"Project Overview\":\nuser\nYou are a proposal writer. Generate a Project Overview for this project. Return ONLY valid JSON with no extra text: {\"type\":\"overview\",\"title\":\"Project Overview\",\"content\":\"YOUR CONTENT HERE\"}. Content must be at least 300 words with **bold** headers. Project: \"Launch a 3-month digital marketing campaign including SEO optimization, social media management, and PPC advertising\". Type: marketing-campaign. Client: MarkedCamp.\nmodel\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"overview\",\n  \"title\": \"Project Overview\",\n  \"content\": \"**Project Title:** Comprehensive 3-Month Digital Marketing Campaign\\n\\n**Client:** MarkedCamp\\n\\n**Project Goal:** The primary objective of this project is to launch and execute a targeted, high-impact 3-month digital marketing campaign designed to significantly increase brand visibility, drive qualified traffic, and generate measurable leads for MarkedCamp. This campaign will employ a multi-faceted digital strategy encompassing Search Engine Optimization (SEO), proactive Social Media Management, and performance-driven Pay-Per-Click (PPC) advertising to ensure maximum reach and conversion efficiency.\\n\\n**Scope of Work:** This project is comprehensive and integrated, designed to cover all critical aspects of the digital marketing funnel. \\n\\n1. **SEO Optimization:** We will conduct thorough keyword research to identify high-intent search terms relevant to MarkedCamp's offerings. This includes on-page optimization (meta descriptions, title tags, content structuring), technical SEO audits to improve site crawlability and speed, and ongoing content gap analysis to ensure the website ranks highly for crucial industry terms. The goal is to establish MarkedCamp as an authoritative voice in its niche.\\n\\n2. **Social Media Management:** A dedicated strategy will be developed for key platforms relevant to the target audience. This involves creating a consistent, engaging content calendar focused on building community, showcasing product/service value, and driving engagement. We will manage daily/weekly posting, community moderation, and performance tracking to maximize organic reach and foster a loyal customer base.\\n\\n3. **PPC Advertising:** We will set up, monitor, and optimize targeted PPC campaigns across relevant platforms (e.g., Google Ads, social media advertising). This includes crafting compelling ad copy, developing precise audience segmentation, managing bid strategies, and rigorous A/B testing of creatives and landing pages to ensure the highest Return on Ad Spend (ROAS). The focus will be on capturing immediate sales opportunities.\\n\\n**Timeline and Deliverables:** The project is structured over a 12-week period, broken down into three distinct monthly phases. Key deliverables will include detailed weekly performance reports, monthly performance reviews analyzing KPIs such as traffic growth, conversion rates, Cost Per Acquisition (CPA), and engagement metrics. The final deliverable will be a comprehensive final report outlining key learnings, identifying top-performing channels, and providing actionable recommendations for future long-term marketing efforts.\\n\\n**Success Metrics:** Success will be measured by achieving predefined targets, including a minimum of [Insert Specific Metric, e.g., 30% increase in qualified website traffic], a targeted improvement in organic search rankings for key terms, a specific conversion rate achieved through PPC channels, and a measurable increase in brand awareness as tracked by social media reach. MarkedCamp aims to achieve a sustainable pipeline of leads and increased brand recognition through this intensive, data-driven campaign.\"\n}\n```"}
